renewal 1y 2mo 10d 4h 30m = P1Y2M10DT4H30M
calendar part P1Y2M10D, time part PT4H30M
years 1, months 2, minutes 30
counts stay separate: 1mo 45d
negated: -1mo 45d
2026-01-31 plus 1mo is 2026-02-28
2026-01-31 plus 30d is 2026-03-02
36h has calendar units false
as an exact duration 36h
uptime 277h 46m 40s
uptime in minutes 16666m 40s
rounded to a quarter hour 1h 30m
